            "notes": " \n<a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/204220/\">Snapshot</a> is Now Available on Mac and is 50% off*!<br><br>Snapshot is the tale of a lone robot lost in an abandoned world. Armed with only his trusty camera, Pic sets forth on his great adventure. A camera might not seem like enough for a puzzle platforming adventure, but this camera is different from most: It has the ability to capture and remove from the world the very objects that it photographs. See what kind of crazy things can happen to Pic with his awesome (and probably magical) camera during the adventure of his life!<br><br>*Discount offer ends November 14th at 10am Pacific time<br><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/204220/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/204220/capsule_467x181.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 181px; width: 467px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
