            "notes": " \n<a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/204220/\">Snapshot</a> is now available on Steam and is 10% off until September 6th at 10am Pacific time!<br><br>Snapshot is the tale of a lone robot lost in an abandoned world.  Armed with only his trusty camera, Pic sets forth on his great adventure.  A camera might not seem like enough for a puzzle platforming adventure, but this camera is different from most:  It has the ability to capture and remove from the world the very objects that it photographs.  Not only that, but it can also use its powers to paste the photos it took back into the environment!<br><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/204220/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/204220/capsule_467x181.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 181px; width: 467px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
